mmits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/pulls/569/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/statuses/b00099783944c3e5263be48126cb8a3eff040c55"}},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/pulls/568","id":4528504508,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFNE1eM8AAAABDet-vA","html_url":"https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel/pull/568","diff_url":"https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel/pull/568.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/driftingly/rector-laravel/pull/568.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/568","number":568,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix silent model corruption in TablePropertyToTableAttributeRector","user":{"login":"edzus","id":43956161,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTU2MTYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43956161?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus","html_url":"https://github.com/edzus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`TablePropertyToTableAttributeRector` rebuilds the `#[Table]` attribute from scratch whenever it\r\nmigrates a property. Two bugs in that rebuild change how the model behaves:\r\n\r\n```php\r\n// before\r\n#[Table(name: 'users', timestamps: false)]\r\nclass User extends Model\r\n{\r\n    protected $primaryKey = null;\r\n}\r\n\r\n// after\r\n#[Table(name: 'users', key: null)]\r\nclass User extends Model {}\r\n```\r\n\r\n1. **`timestamps:` and `dateFormat:` are dropped.** The rebuild reads back only `name`, `key`,\r\n`keyType` and `incrementing`, so the other two arguments are lost. A model that loses\r\n`timestamps: false` starts writing `created_at` / `updated_at` to a table that has no such columns.\r\n\r\n2. **`$primaryKey = null` becomes `key: null`.** Laravel ignores that argument —\r\n`initializeModelAttributes()` guards with `$table->key !== null` — so the model falls back to `'id'`\r\nand `save()` / `delete()` match zero rows silently. `$primaryKey = null` is the only way to declare\r\na model with no single-column key, and `#[Table]` has no argument for it, so the property has to\r\nstay put.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n- Read `timestamps` and `dateFormat` back when rebuilding the attribute.\r\n- Treat a `null` `$primaryKey` as non-convertible: keep the property, emit no `key`.\r\n- Three fixtures covering both.\r\n\r\nThe two fixes are independent, in separate commits.","created_at":"2026-09-14T16:21:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T20:56:15Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"709abc3a4375c1f5500fb5ddc2a241ccb17da803","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/pulls/568/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/pulls/568/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/issues/568/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/driftingly/rector-laravel/statuses/2f16f26b4d0ad1ed0f4d600294529b08e51957a7","head":{"label":"edzus:fix/table-attribute-arg-loss-and-null-key","ref":"fix/table-attribute-arg-loss-and-null-key","sha":"2f16f26b4d0ad1ed0f4d600294529b08e51957a7","user":{"login":"edzus","id":43956161,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTU2MTYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43956161?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus","html_url":"https://github.com/edzus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1370196027,"node_id":"R_kgDOUauIOw","name":"rector-laravel","full_name":"edzus/rector-laravel","private":false,"owner":{"login":"edzus","id":43956161,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTU2MTYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43956161?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus","html_url":"https://github.com/edzus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edzus/received_events","type":"User","u